ZPM

Purpose

ZPM is the seventh major electrical tier of the progression.

This stage represents the transition into extremely high-energy industrial technology.

ZPM production requires highly advanced materials, massive energy infrastructure, complex processing chains, and highly optimized automated factories.

The objective of ZPM is to make the industrial complex operate at a scale where power generation, logistics, processing, and automation must all work together.

