Power

ZPM introduces an extreme increase in energy requirements.

Power generation must operate at massive industrial capacity.

Electrical distribution must support large numbers of high-consumption machines operating simultaneously.

Power networks must be designed for continuous industrial operation.

Energy storage and stabilization become critical components of the infrastructure.

Power shortages should become an important logistical problem at this tier.

