Exit Condition

ZPM is completed when the player has established a massive high-energy industrial complex.

ZPM production must be extensively automated.

Major ZPM materials must have reliable production.

Important ZPM components must be produced automatically.

Advanced chemical and material processing must be fully integrated.

Power generation and distribution must support continuous ZPM production.

The industrial complex must be capable of operating multiple high-consumption machines simultaneously.

The player must be able to produce the components required for UV.

After these requirements are fulfilled, UV is unlocked.

The ultimate goal of ZPM is to establish the infrastructure necessary to enter the highest levels of industrial technology and prepare for the transition toward UV.
